{"seq":2,"slug":"xdp-ddos-mitigation-rate-limit","title":"XDP DDoS 缓解与速率限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/linux-xdp-afxdp-ebpf-fast-datapath/fast-datapath-patterns/xdp-ddos-mitigation-rate-limit","wordCount":2509,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"xdp-ddos-缓解与速率限制\">XDP DDoS 缓解与速率限制</h1><p>一台 10 Gbps 的网关在 SYN flood 下的崩溃点，通常不是带宽被打满，而是<strong>每包处理成本</strong>把 CPU 打满：攻击者用 64 字节的 SYN 逼你为每个包付出 DMA 收包、<code>alloc_skb()</code>、conntrack 查表、路由查找、<code>SYN_RECV</code> 队列插入这些固定开销，而这一切在「判定它是恶意流量」之前就已经花掉了。XDP 的价值在于<strong>把判定点挪到 <code>alloc_skb()</code> 之前</strong>：在驱动 NAPI 的 <code>poll()</code> 里直接读 DMA 缓冲，返回 <code>XDP_DROP</code> 时连 <code>sk_buff</code> 都没构造过。Cloudflare 2018 年的 L4Drop 项目把这条路走通并开源，Meta 2023 年也公开了 eBPF/XDP 加网卡硬件的 DDoS 缓解架构（Meta Engineering，DDoS Mitigations with eBPF, XDP and Network Devices，2023）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-缓解点前移与分层代价模型\">核心概念：缓解点前移与分层代价模型</h2><p>DDoS 缓解的本质是<strong>在成本最低的那一层丢弃最多的包</strong>。每一层都对应一个「每包固定成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」，总成本是各层之和乘以到达速率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{total} = N_{pps} \\times \\sum_{i=0}^{k} c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>XDP 的意义是让被丢弃的包只经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（DMA + NAPI）就终止，而不走到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i=k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（应用层）。同一个 <code>XDP_DROP</code> 与 <code>nftables drop</code> 语义等价，代价上差着一整个协议栈。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓解层</th>\n<th>执行点</th>\n<th>被丢弃包的代价</th>\n<th>可用信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>XDP native</strong></td>\n<td>驱动 NAPI <code>poll()</code>，<code>xdp_buff</code> 直映射 DMA</td>\n<td>DMA + helper 调用</td>\n<td>L2/L3/L4 头（无 <code>skb</code>、无 conntrack）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>XDP offload</strong></td>\n<td>网卡固件</td>\n<td>CPU 零成本</td>\n<td>同 native（<code>bpf_offload</code> 子集）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>tc/BPF clsact ingress</strong></td>\n<td><code>sch_handle_ingress()</code>，<code>skb</code> 已存在</td>\n<td><code>alloc_skb</code> + 可能的 linearize</td>\n<td>L2–L4，可读 <code>skb-&gt;mark</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>nftables / ipset</strong></td>\n<td>netfilter <code>NF_INET_PRE_ROUTING</code></td>\n<td>同上 + 规则匹配</td>\n<td>L3/L4 + 连接跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>iptables hashlimit</strong></td>\n<td>netfilter + xt_hashlimit</td>\n<td>同上 + 每包哈希桶</td>\n<td>L3/L4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分层不是互斥的，而是<strong>纵深</strong>的：XDP 做线速粗筛（体积型、明显伪造源、超频源），tc/BPF 做需要 <code>skb</code> 语义的细判，netfilter 做需要 conntrack 的规则，应用层只处理通过前几层的流量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    DMA[网卡 DMA 写入 RX ring] --&gt; NAPI[驱动 NAPI poll]&#10;    NAPI --&gt; XDP{XDP 程序}&#10;    XDP --&gt;|黑名单 / 超令牌桶速率| DROP[XDP_DROP&lt;br/&gt;零 skb 开销]&#10;    XDP --&gt;|SYN 且无 cookie| SYNACK[伪造 SYN-ACK&lt;br/&gt;XDP_TX 原路返回]&#10;    XDP --&gt;|通过准入| PASS[XDP_PASS]&#10;    XDP --&gt;|需细判/重定向| REDIR[XDP_REDIRECT&lt;br/&gt;AF_XDP 或 tc]&#10;    PASS --&gt; TC[tc/BPF clsact] --&gt; NF[netfilter / conntrack] --&gt; APP[应用层]&#10;    DROP --&gt; STAT[per-CPU 统计 map] --&gt; USR[用户态 agent 聚合]&#10;    USR --&gt;|回写黑名单| XDP\">graph TD\n    DMA[网卡 DMA 写入 RX ring] --&gt; NAPI[驱动 NAPI poll]\n    NAPI --&gt; XDP{XDP 程序}\n    XDP --&gt;|黑名单 / 超令牌桶速率| DROP[XDP_DROP&lt;br/&gt;零 skb 开销]\n    XDP --&gt;|SYN 且无 cookie| SYNACK[伪造 SYN-ACK&lt;br/&gt;XDP_TX 原路返回]\n    XDP --&gt;|通过准入| PASS[XDP_PASS]\n    XDP --&gt;|需细判/重定向| REDIR[XDP_REDIRECT&lt;br/&gt;AF_XDP 或 tc]\n    PASS --&gt; TC[tc/BPF clsact] --&gt; NF[netfilter / conntrack] --&gt; APP[应用层]\n    DROP --&gt; STAT[per-CPU 统计 map] --&gt; USR[用户态 agent 聚合]\n    USR --&gt;|回写黑名单| XDP</pre><p><code>XDP_DROP</code> 不是「拒绝服务」，而是「拒绝为这个包服务」：它不发送任何响应，对攻击者是黑洞。这既是优点（不放大、不消耗上行带宽）也是缺点（误伤的合法流量只能靠超时重传恢复）。因此限速策略必须区分<strong>确定性恶意</strong>（黑名单、明显伪造源）与<strong>概率性超限</strong>（令牌桶拒绝后应允许重传，而非永久封禁）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"令牌桶的-ebpf-实现与-per-cpu-无锁化\">令牌桶的 eBPF 实现与 per-CPU 无锁化</h2><p>令牌桶的数学很简单：桶容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（burst，单位字节或包），补充速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（字节/秒或包/秒）。以懒补充方式实现时，只需在每次包到达时按流逝时间补票：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">tokens \\leftarrow \\min\\left(b,\\ tokens + r \\cdot \\frac{t_{now} - t_{last}}{10^9}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>准入判据是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">tokens \\ge cost</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，通过则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">tokens \\leftarrow tokens - cost</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。<code>bpf_ktime_get_ns()</code> 提供单调时钟；除法在 eBPF 里代价高（内核不总能把它编译成乘法），实用写法是<strong>先算时间差、再乘速率、右移归一化</strong>，避免每包一次真除法。</p>\n<p>真正的工程难点不在公式，而在<strong>状态放哪</strong>。XDP 里不能用全局变量跨 CPU 共享（每个 CPU 有自己的程序副本与栈），所以要选 map：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>BPF_MAP_TYPE_PERCPU_HASH</code>：每个 CPU 一份值副本，读写<strong>无需锁</strong>，读到的就是本 CPU 的桶。代价是全局看到的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{cpu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个独立桶——每个 CPU 桶都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 时，实际总上限是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{cpu} \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>。要接近全局 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，就把每 CPU 桶设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r / N_{cpu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，这是「per-CPU 近似限速」的标准做法。</li>\n<li><code>BPF_MAP_TYPE_LRU_PERCPU_HASH</code>：同上但达到 <code>max_entries</code> 后按 LRU 淘汰。这是<strong>抗内存耗尽</strong>的关键——攻击者可轻易伪造几百万源 IP，普通 hash map 每个新键都占内存，最终 <code>bpf_map_update_elem()</code> 报错；LRU 把 map 当有限容量缓存，用良性流量挤掉攻击者条目。</li>\n<li>需要<strong>精确全局速率</strong>时只能在单键上串行化：<code>bpf_spin_lock()</code>（内核 5.1+，要求值类型含 <code>struct bpf_spin_lock</code>）或原子指令 <code>bpf_atomic_xchg</code>/<code>bpf_fetch_add</code>。两者都在热路径引入跨核争用，只在「全局硬上限」不可妥协时才用。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"struct bucket { __u64 tokens_ns; __u64 last_ns; };&#10;struct { __uint(type, BPF_MAP_TYPE_LRU_PERCPU_HASH);&#10;         __type(key, __u32); __type(value, struct bucket);&#10;         __uint(max_entries, 1 &lt;&lt; 20); } rl SEC(&quot;.maps&quot;);&#10;&#10;SEC(&quot;xdp&quot;)&#10;int rate_limit(struct xdp_md *ctx) {&#10;    __u32 key = src_prefix(ctx);              /* 按 /24 或 /32 聚合 */&#10;    struct bucket *b = bpf_map_lookup_elem(&amp;rl, &amp;key);&#10;    __u64 now = bpf_ktime_get_ns(), dt = now - b-&gt;last_ns;&#10;    __u64 tokens = b-&gt;tokens_ns + (dt * RATE_NS_PER_SEC &gt;&gt; 32);&#10;    if (tokens &gt; BURST_NS) tokens = BURST_NS;&#10;    if (tokens &lt; COST_NS) return XDP_DROP;    /* 超限即丢 */&#10;    b-&gt;tokens_ns = tokens - COST_NS; b-&gt;last_ns = now;&#10;    return XDP_PASS;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket { __u64 tokens_ns; __u64 last_ns; };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">__uint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(type, BPF_MAP_TYPE_LRU_PERCPU_HASH);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">         __type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, __u32); </span><span style=\"co